OL,3,GNEWSACity's 'historic gem' library in
OL,4,Aline for #6.4m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Manchester library described as an
OL,7,F"architectural gem" has been awarded a
OL,8,Frestoration grant of #6.4m which will
OL,9,Fsee it open up all three floors for the
OL,10,Ffirst time in a century.
OL,12,FThe Grade II* listed Portico Library in
OL,13,Fthe city centre dates back to 1806.
OL,15,FThe cash from the National Lottery
OL,16,FHeritage Fund will help with urgent
OL,17,Frepairs, create new spaces and a
OL,18,Fbookshop featuring Northern writers and
OL,19,Fpublishers as well as a kitchen where
OL,20,Fpeople can explore Manchester's food
OL,21,Fculture.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
