OL,3,GNEWSACity's 'historic gem' library in
OL,4,Aline for #6.4m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Thom Keep, the library's chief
OL,7,Fexecutive and librarian, said it was a
OL,8,F"landmark moment" in Portico's history
OL,9,Fand the changes would give people
OL,10,Fgreater access to its 25,000 books and
OL,11,Farchive material.
